00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:10.076
Other projectiles

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.778
being thrown as police

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.446
who answered with tear gas is.

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:13.947
