00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:43.870
Kate.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:45.205
Oh, so sorry.

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:50.076
Melissa.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:51.978
You're doing okay, Melissa.

