The teargas,

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:55.849
the teargas, the teargas is so heavy

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:57.150
Kate out there,

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.686
I can barely breathe, but it's all right.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:00.220
Just, you know what?

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.121
Know, this is,

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:03.556
of course, the very front of the protest.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:04.591
As I was saying a moment ago,

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.959
this is the very front of the protest.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.994
And the idea is that the black bloc,

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.429
as they leave things off, try and see

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.530
confrontation from the police,

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.132
