00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:16.169
I love a lot of them out in the streets

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:16.769
here.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.771
12,000 policemen on the streets

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:21.374
