00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:33.086
we've seen

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:34.020
that have gotten so vital

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:37.023
in these last few weeks to be even better

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.091
attended

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.092
than some of the protest

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.393
we've seen recently

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.995
and possibly

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.763
the best attended May the first protest

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:45.798
