00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.440
that we've seen in a long time, Kate.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.041
Absolutely.

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:56.476
And we're going to stick with you

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.277
