00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:06.119
gas filling your lungs.

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:07.020
But talk to me,

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:07.654
because this

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:08.021
you and I

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:09.889
