00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:10.423
Now it's over

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.592
weeks of Macron had proposed this.

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:14.160
The protesters came out.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:14.894
The constant

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:17.630
the equivalent of the Supreme Court

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:18.865
in France

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:19.999
then said that this

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:21.935
these reforms can go through.

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:23.036
So what what are they

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.204
what going to happen

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:26.839
now, despite all these flash bangs

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:27.674
that I'm hearing behind you

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:31.477
That's right, Kate.

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:32.912
I mean, that's the point.

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:35.014
This is happening right from September.

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:37.650
The French will incrementally start

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.118
working more and more each year.

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:41.054
Until they reach their retirement age

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:41.521
by 20.

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.122
30 of 64,

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:44.824
pretty low by European standards.

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:47.660
But here in France, a very soft nerve,

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:48.962
as you can see.

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.363
And the way that Emmanuel Macron

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:51.464
