00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:11.517
the vast majority of the protesters

00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:13.086
that are following in the march.

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:13.753
I think it's important

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:15.021
