00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:20.326
or in the vast vast majority.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:21.995
But the point is that

00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:22.862
all of the people out here

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.030
